    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1591" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀεί-ζωος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		Trag. 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀεί-ζως</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ων</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ever-living,
