					30
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				174
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀείζως γενεά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					740
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀείζων πένθος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				741
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀείζως θεός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>CIG</u>
					4598
				</span></i>
			 (Palaest.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1247
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἀείζωοι</span>
